UPDATE tools SET faq = $x$[{"a": "Windsurf is now called Devin Desktop, an AI-native code editor from Cognition that evolved from Codeium/Windsurf. Its flagship capability is an agent command center offering autonomous coding agents such as Devin Local, Devin Cloud, Codex, Claude Agent, OpenCode and Cascade, with awareness of your codebase.", "q": "What is Windsurf?"}, {"a": "Devin Desktop (formerly Windsurf) has a free tier with a light agent quota, limited model access, and unlimited Tab completions and inline edits. Pro costs $20 per month for more quota and full model access.", "q": "Is Windsurf free?"}, {"a": "Both are strong AI IDEs and the gap between them is narrowing. Cursor has more features, a larger community, and more model options. Devin Desktop's multi-agent setup and free tier are advantages. Many developers try both; the best choice often comes down to personal workflow preference.", "q": "Is Windsurf better than Cursor?"}, {"a": "Cascade is one of several selectable coding agents available in Devin Desktop, alongside Devin Local, Codex, Claude Agent and OpenCode. It was the original Windsurf agent and can still plan and execute multi-step changes across a project.", "q": "What is Cascade in Windsurf?"}]$x$::jsonb
