UPDATE tools SET description = $x$SurferSEO, rebranded Positive Surfer after its October 2025 acquisition by Positive Group, is a marketing platform that has shifted from classic on-page content optimization toward AI-search visibility, tracking how brands are mentioned across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, AI Mode and Gemini, alongside its Surfy AI assistant and content humanizer.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'surferseo' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$SurferSEO started as an on-page SEO tool built around a Content Editor that scored draft articles against the pages already ranking in Google, giving writers a checklist of terms, headings and length targets to hit.

In late 2025 Surfer was acquired by Positive Group, and the product is now branded Positive Surfer, positioned as an AI Visibility Platform under the tagline 'Be the answer.' There is no numbered version; the legal entity remains Surfer Sp. z o.o. and the product ships continuously. The former surferseo.com domain now redirects to surfer.ai.

The headline capability is tracking brand and page mentions inside AI answer engines such as ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, AI Mode and Gemini, including an MCP connection for feeding these signals into other workflows. Alongside this, Surfer still offers Surfy, a built-in AI assistant, an AI content humanizer, and the original Content Editor, keyword research and audit tools.

Pricing is structured into Discovery at $49/mo billed yearly ($59/mo billed monthly, 120 documents, no AI prompt tracking), Standard at $99/mo billed yearly ($119/mo billed monthly, 25 ChatGPT prompts weekly, 360 documents), Pro at $182/mo billed yearly ($219/mo billed monthly, 50 daily prompts across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Mode, AI Overviews and Gemini, 360 documents, MCP), and Peace of Mind at $299/mo billed yearly ($359/mo billed monthly, 100 daily prompts, unlimited documents, API access), plus a custom Enterprise tier. There is also a standalone AI Search Analytics tier at $82/mo billed yearly ($95/mo billed monthly, 50 daily AI prompts, 5 brand spaces, MCP) for teams that want AI-visibility tracking without the Content Editor. There is no free plan, though Surfer offers a free AI visibility report and trial buttons on its pricing page.

The main limitations are cost, which climbs quickly for teams that need more tracked prompts, and the fact that monthly billing costs roughly 16-20% more than the yearly rate on every tier. GEO metrics are still a young discipline where methodology and reliability are evolving, and the AI humanizer does not guarantee content will pass every detector.

Surfer suits content teams, agencies and in-house marketers who already do serious SEO work and now want to measure and influence how they show up in AI-generated answers, not just traditional search results.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'surferseo' AND lang = 'en';

