 WHERE slug = 'heygen' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description = $x$HeyGen is an AI video platform for creating avatar-driven videos, voice cloning, and translation. Its flagship avatar model, Avatar V, builds a lifelike digital twin from a single 15-second recording.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'heygen' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$HeyGen is a browser-based platform for producing videos presented by AI avatars. You type or paste a script, pick or create an avatar, choose a voice, and the system generates a talking-head video without a camera crew or studio.

Avatar V remains HeyGen's flagship avatar model. It is built from a single 15-second recording and adds full upper-body motion, multi-angle consistency and long-form identity stability, so the same avatar stays believable across longer scripts. Multi-look generation lets you change outfit or background while preserving the original movement. Language coverage runs to 175+ languages on paid plans and 30+ on the free plan.

Beyond avatars, the toolkit includes HeyGen Voice, HeyGen's in-house text-to-speech and voice cloning model, with a faster Turbo variant added in October 2026. It supports speech-to-speech via API, an Instant Voice clone built from under a minute of audio, a higher-fidelity Professional Voice Clone built from 30 minutes to 2 hours of audio (available as an add-on from $29/month), voice generation from a picture, and cross-language delivery that keeps the speaker's accent. HeyGen also offers video translation with lip-sync, a library of 700+ stock avatars on paid plans (500+ on the free plan), and an API for programmatic generation.

Pricing runs on a credit system across five tiers. Free is $0/month: 3 videos/month, up to 1 minute each, watermarked, 1 custom avatar, 30+ languages. Creator is $29/month ($24/month billed annually) with 600 credits/month, videos up to 30 minutes, 1080p, limited access to Avatar V, up to 10 hours of HeyGen Voice TTS, and 175+ languages. Pro is $49/month with 1,000 credits/month (higher tiers scale up to 100,000 credits for $4,300/month), videos up to 30 minutes, 4K output, full Avatar V access, and 16+ hours of HeyGen Voice. Business is $149/month plus $20 per additional seat, with 1,500 credits/month, videos up to 60 minutes, 4K, 5+ custom avatars and SSO. Enterprise pricing is custom and adds SCIM and MFA.

The credit system means real monthly cost is harder to predict than a flat per-video price, since consumption varies by avatar model and feature, and heavier users on lower tiers can run out of allowance before the month ends. Separately, HeyGen's own pages currently give conflicting per-character prices for the HeyGen Voice API, so API costs should be confirmed directly with HeyGen before committing to that usage.

HeyGen suits marketers, training teams, localization teams and creators who need frequent talking-head video and voice generation without filming, and who can work within a credit budget.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'heygen' AND lang = 'en';

